 a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/navigationDocument(_:preview:)-6v0j4":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/navigationDocument(_:preview:)-6v0j4","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"navigationDocument","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"D","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preview","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SharePreview","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI12SharePreviewV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Never","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5NeverO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Never","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5NeverO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"navigationDocument(_:preview:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_drag